  "notes": "Map-first HUD aesthetic: near-black floating panels with 18px radii, thin borders and shadows over a tilted 3D vector map. Amber #fcd34d is the single brand accent (active switch, play button, selected card border/tint, clock colon, histogram bars); mint green dots mark 'live' status. Bilingual Chinese/English labeling with uppercase mono English eyebrows (PARISHES, ROAD WORKS). Layer cards expand when on to show description and a '單獨顯示' (show solo) action. Clicking a road-works marker opens a detail card top-left with key-value info and close button. Left hamburger drawer (closed in capture) holds map settings, font-size control with live preview, language switch and data-source credits. Clock card opens a SET TIME popover with schedule presets, date steppers and density-histogram scrubber."
